
     7.3       : AquaCrop Version (July 2026)
    50         : percentage (%) of ground surface covered by mulches BEFORE growing period
    60         : percentage (%) of ground surface covered by mulches AFTER growing period
    75         : effect (%) of mulches on reduction of soil evaporation
     0         : number of irrigation events BEFORE growing period
     0.0       : quality of irrigation water BEFORE growing period (dS/m)
     2         : number of irrigation events AFTER growing period
     0.0       : quality of irrigation water AFTER growing period (dS/m)
    80         : percentage (%) of soil surface wetted by off-season irrigation

